MGA corrected research implementation

This distribution contains a local research fork derived from Plato, a research
framework for federated learning developed by the TL-System contributors, and
its KNOT federated-unlearning implementation associated with Ningxin Su and
Baochun Li, Asynchronous Federated Unlearning, IEEE INFOCOM 2023.

Upstream project: https://github.com/TL-System/plato
KNOT project: https://ningxinsu.github.io/projects/infocom23/

The parent source distribution carries the Apache License, Version 2.0. A complete
copy is included as LICENSE. Existing upstream copyright and attribution notices
are retained. The inspected parent distribution did not include a NOTICE file;
this file provides added attribution and is not a representation that upstream
supplied this exact notice.

This local fork includes historical research modifications and the corrected MGA
request barrier, client-local poisoning, explicit reverse optimization, validation
and support files. See MODIFICATIONS.md for the modification record.
It is not an official upstream Plato/KNOT release and implies no endorsement.
